      "side": 1,
      "message": "This uses the standard OpenSSH expiry-time option to specify when a key expires. Are you concerned about how this would interact with a future Gerrit-controlled expiry policy, such as a maximum key lifetime? Could you clarify which limitations you see in extending this approach?",
